abstract: >-
  Content-Derived Design CLI and agent skill. Reads existing HTML and writes a
  stronger standalone page from the headings, facts, names, dates, numbers,
  links, emails, and colors already in the file. Auto scores each source into a
  subject lane so nine committed journeys ship nine distinct silhouettes.
